"The elevator in Jack's building supports a maximum load of 700 kg. An adult weighs 80 kg. If Jack rides the elevator with 8 other adults, by how much will they have exceeded the maximum load?","The elevator in Jack's building supports a maximum load of 700 kg. An adult weighs an average of 80 kg. If Jack rides the elevator with 8 other adults, by how much will they have exceeded the maximum load of the elevator?",20,20,20,20,"Step 1: Identify the maximum load of the elevator.
