"Peter plans to go to the movies this week. He always gets a ticket and popcorn for $7 each. If he has 42 dollars for the week, how many times can he go to the movies?","Peter plans to go to the movies this week. He always gets a ticket for $7 and popcorn for $7. If he has 42 dollars for the week, how many times can he go to the movies?",3,3,3,3,"Step 1: Identify the cost per movie visit.
