"The jumbo bottle of shampoo, which is quite large, costs $24.00. The directions say to use 2 pumps of shampoo and this will give you 120 washings. If Jackie, who prefers to be economical, only uses 1 pump per wash, how much will each pump cost, in cents?","The jumbo bottle of shampoo costs $24.00. The directions say to use 2 pumps of shampoo and this will give you 120 washings. If Jackie only uses 1 pump per wash, how much will each pump cost, in cents?",10,10,10,10,"Let's define the quantities:

