"Maggie spent a quarter of her money on books, while Riza spent one-third of her money on clothes. They each had $60 initially. How much money do the two of them have left after their purchases?","Maggie spent a quarter of her money, while Riza spent one-third of her money. They each had $60. How much money do the two of them have left?",85,85,85,85,"Let's go step by step.

