"Mico and Marco wanted to get to know each other better. They realized that the sum of their ages is 20. What will be the sum of their ages in 10 years, after a decade has passed?",Mico and Marco wanted to get to know each other. They realized that the sum of their ages is 20. What will be the sum of their ages in 10 years?,40,40,40,40,"Step 1: Let Mico’s current age be M and Marco’s current age be R.

Step 2: We’re told their current ages add to 20:
